        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          51 Gospel rui Kawmei Laalou Khap latho.",
            "                          10.9.10. 10.Ref. 10. 10.10. 10",
            "",
            "          1 Gospel rui kawmei laalou khap dikho,",
            "            Tingmik 'thuih tiilou ringhmei Chamv tei,",
            "            Tingmik thuih 'naaguang the Ravguangc kandic.",
            "            Kaganv hei katumcna 'naaguang pwthe.",
            "",
            "                     Laupouc rui khuamguang nthuih pwkhou,",
            "                     Laaloumei nunc 'zat biak thangc bam pwni;",
            "                     Laalou makmei nunc baanc haamvpat pwni,",
            "                     Tihkic nyan the twna Pou' saa pwni.",
            "",
            "          2. Khrista Guangcdic Tingkauh chaengmun 'naa the.",
            "             Tingmik'thuih'naa the chamdaanv latho.",
            "             Baanch'raa aching-ching lev key pwni the.",
            "             Kandih kwnkuay maansei khuamguang pwni the.",
            "",
            "          3. Heiczaengrui chanaa thiu chamdaanv latho,",
            "             Gospel rui kawmei laalou la tho.",
            "             Poubauhmei guang pwkhou 'niw neihlaana",
            "             Tingsaeng zaeng gaypui kandic khou lungc ni.",
            "",
            "          4. Ndaapc tari suc-nuc naunianmei maek,",
            "             Chwnsi zaengsi kapmei nai lak khe.",
            "             Poubauhmei guang pwkhou 'niw neihlaana",
            "             Tingsaeng zaeng gaypui kandic khou lungc ni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
